{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, approach and grab it. Process and move to location. Check and drop it.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToTargetLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsTargetLocationReached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />",
    "BT": {
